sequenceDiagram
  participant Sender as Expediteur entrant
  participant EmailWorker as Email Worker Cloudflare
  participant R2 as Archive brute R2
  participant Queue as Evenement Queue / D1
  participant Agent as App ou agent
  participant Approval as Politique d'approbation
  participant Provider as Resend / Postmark
  Sender->>EmailWorker: Envoie un email
  EmailWorker->>EmailWorker: Valide expediteur, taille, pieces jointes
  EmailWorker->>R2: Stocke la copie brute si necessaire
  EmailWorker->>Queue: Ecrit un evenement normalise
  Queue->>Agent: Traite la tache structuree
  Agent->>Approval: Propose une reponse sortante
  Approval-->>Agent: Autorise, refuse ou demande revue humaine
  Agent->>Provider: Envoie l'email transactionnel approuve
